        },
        "subject": "LU-20503 tests: restart grace timer in test_block_soft",
        "message": "LU-20503 tests: restart grace timer in test_block_soft\n\nThe write that crosses the block soft limit also has to write back\nthe data written before the limit was reached, which on a loaded\nsystem takes longer than the grace time. The timer is then already\nexpired when the test issues the writes that must still succeed, so\nthe test measures how fast the filesystem writes back data instead\nof the grace time behaviour and fails with \"write failure, but expect\nsuccess\" (test_3b) or \"mmap write failure, but expect success\"\n(test_3a, LU-18382).\n\nRestart the block grace timer of every quota the test file is subject\nto (the global one and each pool one, the timer is restarted when the\nsoft limit changes) right before those writes, after waiting out the\nslave's 5 second EDQUOT cache. Every quota needs it: in sanity-quota\n3c the file is over both pool soft limits and each pool starts its\nown grace timer.\n\nTest-Parameters: fstype=zfs testlist=sanity-quota env=ONLY=3a,ONLY_REPEAT=30\nTest-Parameters: fstype=zfs testlist=sanity-quota env=ONLY=3b,ONLY_REPEAT=30\nTest-Parameters: fstype=zfs testlist=sanity-quota env=ONLY=3c,ONLY_REPEAT=30\nTest-Parameters: fstype=zfs serverdistro=el10.1 testlist=sanity-quota env=ONLY=3a,ONLY_REPEAT=30\nTest-Parameters: fstype=zfs serverdistro=el10.1 testlist=sanity-quota env=ONLY=3b,ONLY_REPEAT=30\nTest-Parameters: fstype=zfs serverdistro=el10.1 mdtcount=4 ostcount=8 testlist=sanity-quota env=ONLY=3c,ONLY_REPEAT=30\nSigned-off-by: Hongchao Zhang <hongchao@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: I10e22f9e6be238733b3824112f624a2262926de9\n"
      },
